---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About | Shlok Mehndiratta"
  description="Biography, academic trajectory, research philosophy, and Colophon of Shlok Mehndiratta."
>
  <div class="space-y-12 max-w-2xl">
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="space-y-3">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-mono bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-700">
        <span>Trajectory & Colophon</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-50">
        About Me
      </h1>
      <p class="text-base text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">
        Undergraduate researcher, engineer, and quiet observer of signals and structures.
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Narrative Section -->
    <section class="space-y-4 text-sm sm:text-base text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 border-b border-black/[0.06] dark:border-white/[0.06] pb-2">
        Background & Scientific Foundation
      </h2>
      <p>
        I am currently in my final year pursuing a <strong>Bachelor of Science (BS) in Electrical Engineering and Computer Science (EECS)</strong> at the <strong>Indian Institute of Science Education and Research (IISER) Bhopal</strong>.
      </p>
      <p>
        Coming from an institution founded on foundational scientific inquiry has profoundly shaped the way I think about engineering problems. Rather than viewing machine learning or algorithms as black-box tools, I am drawn to their underlying physics and mathematical structures: linear algebra, dynamical systems, probability theory, and optimization.
      </p>
      <p>
        My undergraduate work has revolved around estimation on graphs, signal recovery from noisy observations, and multi-agent coordination. Through research internships and my ongoing thesis, I have developed a passion for rigorous theoretical modeling paired with reproducible code.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Academic Timeline -->
    <section class="space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 border-b border-black/[0.06] dark:border-white/[0.06] pb-2">
        Timeline
      </h2>
      <div class="space-y-4 text-sm">
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline gap-1 sm:gap-6">
          <span class="font-mono text-xs text-zinc-400 dark:text-zinc-500 w-28 shrink-0">2022 – 2026</span>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">BS in EECS, IISER Bhopal</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400">Department of Electrical Engineering and Computer Science</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline gap-1 sm:gap-6">
          <span class="font-mono text-xs text-zinc-400 dark:text-zinc-500 w-28 shrink-0">Summer 2025</span>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">Research Internship</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400">Asynchronous multi-agent consensus & swarm algorithms</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline gap-1 sm:gap-6">
          <span class="font-mono text-xs text-zinc-400 dark:text-zinc-500 w-28 shrink-0">Present</span>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">Applying for MS & PhD Abroad</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400">Seeking opportunities in Signal Processing, Systems, and Network Intelligence</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Colophon -->
    <section class="space-y-3 pt-6 border-t border-black/[0.06] dark:border-white/[0.06]">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">
        Colophon
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xs text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
        This website is an intentional exercise in craftsmanship and longevity. It is statically generated using <strong>Astro 5</strong>, styled with <strong>Tailwind CSS</strong>, and rendered with <strong>KaTeX</strong> for mathematics and <strong>Shiki</strong> for code. The sans-serif typeface is <strong>Geist</strong> (designed by Vercel), with accents in <strong>JetBrains Mono</strong> and <strong>Newsreader</strong>.
      </p>
      <p class="text-xs text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400 font-mono">
        Zero cookies • Zero third-party tracking scripts • Sub-second load times worldwide
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
